WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:05,740
I'll have a pepper steak, medium well, some pasta, and a vegetable salad.

2
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:10,680
I'm not keen on starters or soup, so I'll skip those, thank you.

3
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:13,814
no problem

4
00:00:13,814 --> 00:00:20,865
I don't like eating western food very much

5
00:00:20,865 --> 00:00:28,700
I’m not used to eating foreign food.

6
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:32,700
Even if I want to eat, I can only accept these dishes that are closer to Chinese people’s eating habits.

7
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:40,420
I have lived in London for several years, so I have this accent and my skill in ordering food.

8
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:44,050
Have you been to England?

9
00:00:44,050 --> 00:00:46,660
So you were asking about the accent?

10
00:00:46,660 --> 00:00:48,970
No.

11
00:00:48,970 --> 00:00:49,970
Your English is very good.

12
00:00:49,970 --> 00:00:55,940
Just a few simple sentences.

13
00:00:55,940 --> 00:00:56,940
Simple?

14
00:00:56,940 --> 00:01:01,030
The sentences and words you mentioned are not found in domestic university textbooks.

15
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:05,480
Moreover, you speak with a true London accent.

16
00:01:05,480 --> 00:01:08,510
Don't talk about the textbook, what you care about is his accent, right?

17
00:01:08,510 --> 00:01:13,080
Then who did you learn your accent from?
